{"id":13110267312,"name":"Animal Sim: Underwater","desc":"Controls:\nQ - Attack\nShift - Run/Walk\nR - Sit\nT - Rest\n\n*This is not the main animal simulator, this is a different game","path":"/game/13110267312-animal-sim-underwater","slug":"13110267312-animal-sim-underwater","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c64f1d509a9b793f4d0556d60c8255ba/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-228b9a275d6bf0849df5d6b05e4ea0ad/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":704,"visitor":270397714,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-22T19:40:11.717Z","creator":{"name":"Animal Sims.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Animal-Sim:-Underwater-Skins-Unlocker-60119","_id":"68f9331b4ec2e2af18abe51c","title":"Skins Unlocker","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78125","gameId":13110267312,"name":"Animal Sim: Underwater","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-228b9a275d6bf0849df5d6b05e4ea0ad-6825ffecc59c.png","placeId":13110267312},"features":"🐟 Animal Sim: Underwater 🦈\n\nThis script unlocks all skins by turning on every BoolValue in the game. Yeah, most games(tho I know only one game) use BoolValues to track if you own a skin, like when you buy a skin and e.t.c, it flips from false to true. This script just sets them all to true at once so you get everything. It also enables all other BoolValues in the game which might let you do stuff like swimming in air or other abilities that are basically locked. After it's done, a notification pops up that says that the script is working and skins are unlocked, bla bla bla.\n\nBy the way, the script is open-source! Feel free to use it in your projects.\n\n🐟 Animal Sim: Underwater 🦈","tags":["Animal","Animal Simulator","Animal Sim","Animal Simulator Underwater","Animal Sim Underwater"],"script":"local function enableBoolValues(parent)\n    for _, child in pairs(parent:GetDescendants()) do\n        if child:IsA(\"BoolValue\") then\n            child.Value = true\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nenableBoolValues(game)\n\ngame:GetService(\"StarterGui\"):SetCore(\"SendNotification\", {\n    Title = \"Unlock Success!\";\n    Text = \"Almost all available skins are successfully unlocked.\";\n    Icon = \"rbxassetid://110780237082692\";\n    Duration = 5;\n})","owner":{"_id":"68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b","username":"akrion","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b-1761162633864.png","status":"offline","id":"68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":6551,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/13110267312-1761162011700.png","likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-10-22T19:40:11.718Z","executes":1733,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68f9331b4ec2e2af18abe51e","editBy":{"_id":"68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b","username":"akrion","status":"offline","id":"68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-10-22T19:40:11.726Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69006bc0fc6735c64f7c43de","commentBy":{"_id":"69006746fbf08a5d54546bc6","username":"Haha63829","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","createdAt":"2025-10-28T06:48:38.198Z","lastActive":"2025-10-29T05:30:34.536Z","status":"offline","id":"69006746fbf08a5d54546bc6"},"text":"doesn't work instead it makes me fly swim Basically I can fly on air or swim whatever u call it","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-10-28T07:07:44.899Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"690150594bf26da258d34ca9","commentBy":{"_id":"68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b","username":"akrion","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/68ee4d5bcf8acc8169786a9b-1761162633864.png","createdAt":"2025-10-14T13:17:15.580Z","lastActive":"2026-03-28T14:00:14.974Z","status":"offl